#. <CLT 3>電波ジャック<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're talking about you <CLT 3>hijacking the airwaves<CLT>,\n"
"aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. うんうん、そういう事だね。
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Uh-huh. That's exactly what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

#. 希望の象徴である希望ヶ峰学園生のコロシアイを
#. 世間に見せ付ける事こそが…
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"To show the world the murders taking place at this\n"
"school, which was meant to be a symbol of hope..."
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の絶望の本当の目的！
#. つまり、人類絶望化計画のクライマックスなんだよ！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That was the whole point of the Ultimate Despair! When\n"
"I said \"climax,\" THAT was what I was talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. あなた達<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>が、絶望に打ちひしがれ、
#. コロシアイする姿を見る事で…
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The world watched as you <CLT 3>fell into despair<CLT>, and\n"
"began to kill each other one after another..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望は伝染し、
#. 残った希望も絶望へと変わっていくのよ。
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Despair is as contagious as any disease; any hope left\n"
"turns to despair."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…テレビの力ってスゴイっすね！！
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu. Isn't the power of television just amazing!?"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、オマエラを助けようとする連中が、
#. 放送中に何度か押し寄せて来ましたが…
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"By the way, since we started broadcasting, a whole\n"
"bunch of people have tried to come and rescue you."
msgstr ""

#. き、来てたの！？　助けが！？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "A-Are you serious!?"
msgstr ""

#. 校門に設置した重火器によって、
#. キレイに排除しておきました。
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But utilizing the heavy weaponry I installed around\n"
"the school grounds, I had no problem expelling them."
msgstr ""

#. は…い…じょ…？
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You...expelled them?"
msgstr ""

#. あなた方のお陰です…
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I have to thank you all."
msgstr ""

#. 希望を捨てられないあまりに実力行使に及ぶ、
#. この上なく未練がましい連中に…
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"They were a relentless bunch, refusing to give up on\n"
"hope and trying to force their beliefs on the world."
msgstr ""

#. 最後の絶望である<CLT 3>“死”<CLT>を与える事が出来ました。
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But in the end, I was able to give them the final\n"
"despair—<CLT 3>death<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達を…利用してたって事か…？
#. 外の人達に…絶望を与える為…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you just used us? To bring despair to everyone in\n"
"the outside world...?"
msgstr ""

#. でもさぁ、そのお陰で生きるチャンスを貰えたんだし、
#. ギブアンドテイクってヤツじゃない？
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well sure, but I also gave you a second chance at\n"
"life, right? So it's like...give and take!"
msgstr ""

#. ふざけるな…！　どこがだよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Give and take!? You're so full of...shit!"
msgstr ""

#. それとね、ここの全校生徒を皆殺しにした時…
#. 生き残ってもらうメンバーにみんなを選んだ理由はね…
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And there's a reason I chose you guys to survive, when\n"
"all the other students were dropping like flies..."
msgstr ""

#. ２年間を一緒に過ごした思い出って言うか…
#. やっぱ、大切なクラスメイトだし…
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I mean, we built up two years of memories together.\n"
"You were all my treasured classmates..."
msgstr ""

#. ウソです…黒幕がクラスメイトだった方が、
#. 謎が解けた時の絶望も大きいと思っただけです…
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Sorry, that's a lie. I just figured you'd despair even\n"
"more when you found out a friend had betrayed you."
msgstr ""

#. これが真実よ！　あなた達が欲していた真実なのよ！
#. どう、絶望したでしょう？
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And that's the truth! Which is what you wanted, right?\n"
"So? Does it make you feel utterly lost and hopeless?"
msgstr ""

#. 謎が解けて絶望したでしょう！？
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You solved the mystery but despair at the truth,\n"
"right!?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、あなたは…
#. 謎が解かれる展開すら計算に入れて…？
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me... Did you seriously count on the\n"
"possibility that we would solve your mystery?"
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、どうする？
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And if we did? Then what?"
msgstr ""

#. この絶望的状況を作り出す事こそ、
#. 最後の学級裁判を受けた私様の真意だったなら…
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Our final desire for creating this world of despair\n"
"was so we could experience one last class trial."
msgstr ""

#. あえて、あなた達自身に謎を解かせ、
#. 絶望的な真相を見せ付ける事が真意だったなら…
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you were bold enough to solve the mystery, only to\n"
"discover that the truth was utterly hopeless..."
msgstr ""

#. …だとしたら、どうするの！？
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...how would you react? What would you do?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0028 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ほらね、真実が希望に満ちているとは、
#. 限らないんだよ。
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"See? Discovering the truth doesn't necessarily lead to\n"
"a sense of hope."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望に満ちた真実だって存在すんだよぉ！
#. ちょうど、今みてーになぁ！！
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Truth can be full of despair, too! Like right fuckin'\n"
"now!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>絶望に満ちた…真実……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Truth...full of despair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな…そんなのって…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにね…例の<CLT 3>“動機”<CLT>も、
#. 本当は無意味なものばかりだったんだよ。
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Not to mention, all those <CLT 3>motives<CLT> I talked about\n"
"were totally meaningless."
msgstr ""

#. 世界が終わった今となってはね…
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I mean, with the world having ended and all..."
msgstr ""

#. 無意味って…
#. じゃあ、私達は…
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Meaningless? Then we..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな無意味なものの為に…
#. 今まで…殺し合いをしてたの…？
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We've been murdering each other...for nothing?"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、自分達で閉じ込められる事を選んだのに…
#. そこから出る為の殺し合いなんかを…です。
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And think about it. You chose to lock yourselves up\n"
"here, then started murdering each other to get out..."
msgstr ""

#. それも２年間を共にした…クラスメイト同士で…
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We weren't just random strangers, either. We were\n"
"classmates. We'd spent two years together..."
msgstr ""

#. クッ…！
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Kh—!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲ……笑えねーわ…
msgctxt "0040 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeha—! No, even I can't laugh at that."
msgstr ""

#. も、もう…わかったべ…
msgctxt "0041 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "We get it... We get it, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. オメーがスゲーのは…
#. もう十分過ぎるほどわかったから…
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You're totally awesome, right? We get it already!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、もう助けてくれよ！
#. なんでもするから助けてくれって！！
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So help us! I'll do anything! Just help me!"
msgstr ""

#. なるほど、それが人間の命乞いね！
#. さすがの私様も初めて見るほどの無様さだわ！
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"A peasant begging for his life? How delightful! We've\n"
"never witnessed such a travesty firsthand..."
msgstr ""

#. でもね、ボクに命乞いは通じないんだよ。
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But I'm sorry to say, begging doesn't work on me."
msgstr ""

#. ボクは、ただ純粋に絶望を求めているだけなんだ。
#. そこには、一切の理由がないんだよ。
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "All I want is despair. And there's no reason for it."
msgstr ""

#. 理由がないから対策も出来ない…
#. 理由がないから理解も出来ない…
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And since there's no reason, there's no argument\n"
"against it. There's just no understanding it."
msgstr ""

#. 対策も理解も出来ない理不尽さ！
#. それが<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>なんだよ！
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"No argument, no understanding... What better\n"
"definition of <CLT 3>ultimate despair<CLT> could there be!?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと…待てよ…
#. さっきから…好き放題言ってるけど…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, hold on... You've just been going on about\n"
"whatever you feel like, but..."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、お前の言葉が本当だなんて、
#. 言い切れないはずだ…！
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But there's no real reason for us to believe anything\n"
"you have to say!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …は？
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 外の世界は滅びてるとか…
#. ボクは自分の目で見た訳じゃない…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You say the world's fallen apart. But I haven't seen\n"
"it for myself."
msgstr ""

#. そんなの…認めない…！
#. 真実だなんて…認められない…！
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So I don't acknowledge it...! I don't accept it as the\n"
"truth!"
msgstr ""

#. 自分の目で確認するまでは、
#. 真実とウソは、互いに重なり合った状態…
msgctxt "0055 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Until you see it with your own eyes, truth and\n"
"falsehood overlap one another."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、シュレーディンガーの猫のような苗木クン…
#. そういう状態だと言うのですね？
msgctxt "0056 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"In other words, you're not unlike Schroedinger's cat\n"
"right now. Is that what you're saying?"
msgstr ""

#. だから…どうだと言うのです？
msgctxt "0057 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "If so, what then?"
msgstr ""

#. 外に出て、自分の目で確かめるまでは、
#. 認めないとか言うつもりぃ！？
msgctxt "0058 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Are you saying you won't accept the truth until you\n"
"can go outside and see for yourself!?"
msgstr ""

#. やめときなって！　滅びた世界に出たところで、
#. みんなまで滅びちゃうだけだって！
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well you better not! You go out into that world, and\n"
"you're all goners for sure!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、わたしはウソなんか言ってないもーん！
msgctxt "0060 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Trust me, I'm not lying about any of this!"
msgstr ""

#. た、たとえ本当だったとしてもだ…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well...even if it's all true..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクはお前なんかに屈したくない…！
#. お前なんかに負けたくない…！
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I refuse to give in! I refuse to lose to you!"
msgstr ""

#. お前に殺された…みんなの為にもだ！
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "For the sake of everyone you've killed...!"
msgstr ""

#. へ？　ボクに殺された？
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? Everyone I've killed?"
msgstr ""

#. 何言ってんの？
#. オマエラが勝手に殺し合っただけじゃん！
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about? You're the ones who killed\n"
"them."
msgstr ""

#. 私が殺した訳ではありません。
#. 私は、あなた方の背中を軽く押しただけです。
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I didn't kill anyone. I simply gave you a little nudge\n"
"in the right direction."
msgstr ""

#. その程度で殺し合うって事は…
#. あなた達は…どちらにしても争う生き物なんです…
msgctxt "0067 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And that's all it took for you to start killing each\n"
"other. You're nothing but bloodthirsty animals..."
msgstr ""

#. だから殺し合いが起きたのだ、人間よ！
msgctxt "0068 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's why anyone was murdered here, peasant!"
msgstr ""

#. 希望だのなんだの言われてもさぁ、
#. みんな、簡単に絶望する生き物なんだよ？
msgctxt "0069 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Say what you want about hope, but we're all creatures\n"
"of instinct, right? Despair comes naturally!"
msgstr ""

#. イエス！　超ウケる！！
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hell yes! That's funny as shit!"
msgstr ""

#. 違う…！　殺し合いなんかじゃない…！
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...! This isn't just some game to us!"
msgstr ""

#. あんなの一方的な殺人だ…！
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's murder, plain and simple!"
msgstr ""

#. ボク達の記憶を奪って、動機をでっち上げて、
#. そうやって、みんなを追い詰めて…
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You stole our memories, invented reasons for us to do\n"
"it... You pushed us all into a corner...!"
msgstr ""

#. 全部、お前のせいじゃないか！
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's all your fault!"
msgstr ""

#. なるほど…お見事な責任転嫁だよ…
#. それが、苗木クンの<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>なんだね？
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You certainly have a talent for passing the buck,\n"
"don't you? That must be your <CLT 3>hope<CLT>, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、これ以上、お喋りしている時間はないんだ。
#. そろそろ終わらせないといけないからさ…
msgctxt "0076 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But we don't have much time left to keep up this\n"
"banter. We have to draw things to a close soon..."
msgstr ""

#. 終わらせる…？
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、<CLT 3>投票<CLT>だよーっ！
#. だって、そういうルールでしょ？
msgctxt "0078 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I'm talking about <CLT 3>the vote<CLT>, of course! You didn't\n"
"forget about that little rule, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみにね、今回は最後の投票なので、
#. 投票のルール自体も変更する事にしたんだー！
msgctxt "0079 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Oh! And also, since this'll be the last vote, I\n"
"decided to change the rules!"
msgstr ""

#. 変更…？
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 希望であるオマエラ…
#. 絶望であるボク…
msgctxt "0081 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You guys so full of hope... And me so full of\n"
"despair..."
msgstr ""

#. そのどちらが“おしおき”されるべきかを
#. 投票で選んでもらいます。
msgctxt "0082 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I've decided to have you vote which one will be\n"
"punished!"
msgstr ""

#. そこで、１票でも、
#. <CLT 3>希望の“おしおき”<CLT>を望む投票があれば…
msgctxt "0083 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If even one of you votes to <CLT 3>punish hope<CLT>, well\n"
"then..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクの勝ちとみなして、
#. 希望側の“おしおき”を行いまーす！
msgctxt "0084 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"...I'll consider that a win for me, and punish\n"
"everyone on the side of hope!"
msgstr ""

#. い、１票でもって…！？
msgctxt "0085 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Even if it's just one person...?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、安心して。
#. もちろん、ボクは投票には参加しないから。
msgctxt "0086 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oh, but don't worry. I won't be voting, of course."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それにしたって、オメーに有利過ぎだろ！
msgctxt "0087 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Even if you don't, you've still got the upper hand in\n"
"all this!"
msgstr ""

#. 大丈夫だよ…自分達の処刑を選ぶなんて…
#. 誰も…そんな事するはずないんだ…
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's okay. Nobody would actually vote to kill\n"
"themselves, right?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ついでに言っておくね。
#. ボクが勝った場合のオマエラの<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>だけど…
msgctxt "0089 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Oh, let me just mention one more thing. When I win, to\n"
"<CLT 3>punish<CLT> you guys..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園内で、穏やかに緩やかに老衰してもらう！
#. という<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>に決定しましたー！
msgctxt "0090 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You'll have to stay here till you grow old and die. No\n"
"fighting, no killing. That's your <CLT 3>punishment<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…え？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それって…つまり…
msgctxt "0092 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You mean...we'd just..."
msgstr ""

#. このまま…ここで暮せって事…？
msgctxt "0093 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We'd have to just...live here?"
msgstr ""

#. 生き延びられるって事じゃん！！
msgctxt "0094 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "She's saying she'll let us live!"
msgstr ""

#. それが気に入らないなら…
#. 私を<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>して…外に出て行けばいいんです…
msgctxt "0095 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you're not happy with that...then go ahead and\n"
"<CLT 3>punish me<CLT>, and make your way to the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. 滅びた世界…絶望だけが存在する外の世界にね。
#. おそらく、すぐに死ねると思いますよ。
msgctxt "0096 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Enter a world fallen from grace, where only despair\n"
"exists. Where you'd likely be dead within a day."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だから…どうしたって言うんだ…！
#. 何を言われても…ボク達は…！
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wh-What are you saying? So no matter what, we're\n"
"doomed...!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと待てよ！　閃いちまったぞ！
msgctxt "0098 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Wait a sec! I just got hit with an inspiration bomb..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、老衰だけじゃツマんねーよな？
#. それじゃ、視聴者も納得しねーよな？
msgctxt "0099 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Dying of old age is boring as shit, right? The\n"
"audience at home isn't gonna dig that at all!"
msgstr ""

#. よし決めた！　オメェらの中の１人だけは、
#. キッチリと<CLT 3>ド派手な“おしおき”<CLT>を受けてもらうぜ！
msgctxt "0100 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, here's what'll happen! One of you will get to\n"
"experience an instant, <CLT 3>super impressive punishment<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　そ、それって…！
msgctxt "0101 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What!? Y-You can't just—!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰か１人だけを処刑する…という事か？
msgctxt "0102 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Do you mean to say...you'll execute one of us?"
msgstr ""

#. そいつが誰か…こっちで勝手に決めてやったぞ！！
msgctxt "0103 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And I get to decide...who's gonna hafta suck it down!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木！　オメェだ！！
msgctxt "0104 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Makoto! You're up!"
msgstr ""

#. …ボ、ボク？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...M-Me?"
msgstr ""

#. わたし、苗木クンってきらーい！
#. だって、さっきから反抗的なんだもーん！
msgctxt "0106 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Yeah! You've been acting up, causing all kinds of\n"
"trouble! I haaate you!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、みなさんに与えられた選択肢は２つ…
msgctxt "0107 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, let me make this clear. Everyone has two choices\n"
"in front of them."
msgstr ""

#. 誰か１人でも、
#. 希望の<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>を望む人がいれば…
msgctxt "0108 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If a single person votes for \"hope\" to be\n"
"<CLT 3>punished<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンだけが過酷な<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>を受け、
#. 他のみんなは、この学園で仲良く暮らせる。
msgctxt "0109 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"...then only Makoto will receive a harsh <CLT 3>punishment<CLT>,\n"
"and the rest of you will live here in peace."
msgstr ""

#. だが、もし全員一致で私様の<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>を望めば、
#. あなた達には、ここから出て行ってもらうわよ。
msgctxt "0110 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If, on the other hand, you desire to see us\n"
"<CLT 3>punished<CLT>, then you must all leave this place."
msgstr ""

#. 確実に出て行ってもらいます。
#. そして、外の世界で無残に死んでもらいます。
msgctxt "0111 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I will force you out, ensuring you all die horrible\n"
"deaths in the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、苗木を犠牲にすりゃ、
#. オメェらは生き残れんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0112 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What I'm saying is, if you sacrifice Makoto, the rest\n"
"of you will get to live out your lives."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボ、ボクを犠牲に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sacrifice me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな…そんなのって…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>B-But that's—!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おや？　元気がなくなったね？　自信がないの？
#. 自分が“おしおき”されるのが怖いの？
msgctxt "0115 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What, has your resolve softened? Have you lost\n"
"confidence? Are you afraid of being punished?"
msgstr ""

#. 仲間を信用してないの？
msgctxt "0116 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Don't you have faith in your friends?"
msgstr ""

#. ち、違う…そういう訳じゃ…！
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, that's not it...!"
msgstr ""

#. ですが、恐怖を覚えるのも当然です。
msgctxt "0118 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's okay. You're right to be afraid."
msgstr ""

#. 他の方々は、私と争う事の無意味さに
#. 気付いてしまったようですからね…
msgctxt "0119 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It would seem all of those around you have realized\n"
"the futility of going against me."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0120 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0121 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0122 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0123 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. み、みんな…？
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "G-Guys...?"
msgstr ""

#. いい…すごくいい顔です…
#. 絶望に浸食された美しい顔が並んでいます…
msgctxt "0125 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It's so beautiful... Your lovely faces, eroded by\n"
"despair, have come together as one..."
msgstr ""

#. それに、霧切さんもさ、
#. お父さんを裏切れないでしょ？
msgctxt "0126 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Besides... Kyoko, you could never betray your father,\n"
"could you?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0127 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、オマエラに生き延びてもらう事だけが、
#. 学園長の願いだったんだよ？
msgctxt "0128 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I mean, the headmaster's only wish was that all of you\n"
"would survive, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、この学園の中に閉じ込めてまで、
#. オマエラを保護しようとしたんじゃん！
msgctxt "0129 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's why he tried to trap you all here, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. 死んだお父さんの願いくらい叶えてあげなよ…
#. うぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0130 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The least you can do is try to honor your dead\n"
"father's wishes. Puhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0131 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. き、霧切さん…！
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...!"
msgstr ""

#. たった１人の絶望が命取りなんて、
#. 苗木にとっては、最悪に絶望的な状況だなぁ！？
msgctxt "0133 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"One person's despair is enough to seal your fate.\n"
"Isn't that just the most hopeless outcome ever!?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇねぇ、誰が絶望すると思う？
#. 誰の絶望が苗木クンを殺すと思う？
msgctxt "0134 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So who do you think's gonna give in? Whose despair is\n"
"gonna sign your death warrant!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 誰も…絶望なんかしない…！
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No one... Nobody's gonna give in to despair!"
msgstr ""

#. みんな…お前なんかに負けないんだ…！
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We're not gonna lose to you!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0138 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. つまんないの…
#. 最後まで強情なんだからさ…
msgctxt "0139 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "So boring. Stubborn till the very end, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、いいや。
#. じゃあ、さっさと終わらせよっか…
msgctxt "0140 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well, that's fine. Then let's just hurry up and get it\n"
"over with."
msgstr ""

#. 最後の投票…そこですべて終わりだよ。
#. オマエの臭い希望も…
msgctxt "0141 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It's time for the final vote. Everything will come to\n"
"an end. Your stupid hope..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエ自身もなッ！！
msgctxt "0142 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And your stupid life!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最後の投票…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The final vote...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが…最後の決戦…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is it... The ultimate confrontation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、みんなを説得するんだ…
#. みんなに思い出してもらうんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to show everyone... I have to make them\n"
"remember!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>諦めちゃ駄目だって事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0146 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to convince them not to give up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>絶望しながら生きていくなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To live in despair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなの…生きてるなんて言えないよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's not really living at all!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
